{"page":356,"verses":[{"verse_key":"24:44","surah":24,"ayah":44,"ar_uthmani":"يُقَلِّبُ ٱللَّهُ ٱلَّيْلَ وَٱلنَّهَارَ ۚ إِنَّ فِى ذَٰلِكَ لَعِبْرَةً لِّأُو۟لِى ٱلْأَبْصَـٰرِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"God alternates night and day- there truly is a lesson in [all] this for those who have eyes to see-","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يُقَلِّبُ","en_gloss":"Allah alternates","transliteration":"yuqallibu","verse_key":"24:44"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah alternates","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"24:44"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلَّيْلَ","en_gloss":"the night","transliteration":"al-layla","verse_key":"24:44"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَٱلنَّهَارَ ۚ","en_gloss":"and the day","transliteration":"wal-nahāra","verse_key":"24:44"},{"pos":5,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"24:44"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"24:44"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"dhālika","verse_key":"24:44"},{"pos":8,"ar":"لَعِبْرَةًۭ","en_gloss":"surely is a lesson","transliteration":"laʿib'ratan","verse_key":"24:44"},{"pos":9,"ar":"لِّأُو۟لِى","en_gloss":"for those who have vision","transliteration":"li-ulī","verse_key":"24:44"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلْأَبْصَـٰرِ","en_gloss":"for those who have vision","transliteration":"l-abṣāri","verse_key":"24:44"},{"pos":11,"ar":"٤٤","en_gloss":"(44)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"24:44"}]},{"verse_key":"24:45","surah":24,"ayah":45,"ar_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ خَلَقَ كُلَّ دَآبَّةٍ مِّن مَّآءٍ ۖ فَمِنْهُم مَّن يَمْشِى عَلَىٰ بَطْنِهِۦ وَمِنْهُم مَّن يَمْشِى عَلَىٰ رِجْلَيْنِ وَمِنْهُم مَّن يَمْشِى عَلَىٰٓ أَرْبَعٍ ۚ يَخْلُقُ ٱللَّهُ مَا يَشَآءُ ۚ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ عَلَىٰ كُلِّ شَىْءٍ قَدِيرٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"and God created each animal out of [its own] fluid: some of them crawl on their bellies, some walk on two legs, and some on four. God creates whatever He will; God has power over everything.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"And Allah","t